 90→Generate 4-8 evaluation dimensions that are SPECIFIC to this JD. Common dimensions include (but adapt based on what matters for THIS role):
 91→- Skill Relevance, Experience Depth, Domain Fit, Tool Familiarity, Seniority Match, Leadership Signals, Education Alignment
 92→
 93→Return ONLY valid JSON. No markdown, no explanation.`;
 94→
 95→    const systemPrompt = customJdPrompt || hardcodedJdPrompt;
 96→
 97→    const response = await fetch("https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions", {
 98→      method: "POST",
 99→      headers: {
100→        Authorization: `Bearer ${OPENAI_API_KEY}`,
101→        "Content-Type": "application/json",
102→      },
103→      body: JSON.stringify({
104→        model,
105→        messages: [
